    "body": "This is not the state we should be using, imo.  The state we should be using is state at the entrypoint to \"navigate\", not at this later point in time, just like we do for the `sandboxFlags` in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate step 14.\r\n\r\nThis even matters if we use the document's sandbox flags, since those can change over time thanks to meta CSP...",
